---
title: Terms of Service
description: Read the terms and guidelines for participating in SEDS Sri Lanka activities, projects, and online resources.
---

Welcome to SEDS Sri Lanka. By accessing our website, participating in our university chapters, or joining technical division activities, you agree to comply with the following guidelines and terms.

### 1. Community Guidelines & Inclusivity

SEDS Sri Lanka is a non-profit student community dedicated to fostering space science and engineering education. We maintain a zero-tolerance policy for harassment, discrimination, or abusive behavior in any club channel, study circle, workshop, or competition.

### 2. Student Projects & Open Collaboration

Materials, tutorials, and project documentation created by SEDS Sri Lanka are designed for educational enrichment. When building and testing hardware (such as model rockets, drones, or high-voltage circuits), members must adhere to strict safety guidelines and obtain appropriate supervision.

### 3. Official Merchandise & Orders

All merchandise sales (including official T-shirts, stickers, and wristbands) directly support student projects and community initiatives. Order confirmations and shipping timelines are communicated following payment receipt verification.

### 4. Contact & Inquiries

For questions or concerns regarding our terms or community guidelines, please contact us:

- **Email**: [contact@sedssl.org](mailto:contact@sedssl.org)
- **Website**: [sedssl.org](https://sedssl.org)
